# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Tunable parameters (D213) and the compile cache (D212) on the
# GPU: the values of tunables are runtime data, not part of the module that
# keys a cached host object, so a compile with other values hits the first
# compile's entry and runs, to the bit, as one compiled without the cache,
# with its own values; an update compiles nothing.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide cache GPU Double %t | FileCheck %s
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide cache GPU Mixed %t | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU {{Double|Mixed}}: a compile with other values hits the cached object of the first
# CHECK: cache passed
